                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Clean then Rebuild fails:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;CS0234	The type or namespace name &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;Linq&apos;&lt;/span&gt; does not exist in the namespace &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;Apache.Ignite&apos;&lt;/span&gt; (are you missing an assembly reference?)	Apache.Ignite.Examples	C:\W\incubator-ignite\modules\platforms\dotnet\Examples\Apache.Ignite.Examples\Datagrid\LinqExample.cs
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Consequent build succeeds.&lt;br/&gt;
